title: AWS S3 Bucket
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors AWS S3 bucket metrics via CloudWatch.

 Note: S3 CloudWatch metrics are reported once per day.

 Monitored metrics:

 - Bucket Size: Total size of all objects in the bucket in bytes
   (sum across storage classes)

 - Number of Objects: Total count of objects in the bucket
   (AllStorageTypes)

 S3 metrics are published daily by AWS.
 Corresponding TTL information is available in service details.

 Thresholds can be configured for bucket size and object count.

discovery:
 One service is created for each S3 bucket discovered.
